    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEd Dempsey & Associates are pleased to present this compact furnished studio in Portobello, Dublin 8.\n\nFeaturing high ceilings, decorative cornicing and a large window, the property combines period character with a practical layout. The accommodation comprises an open-plan living area with a sofa and raised sleeping platform, a fitted kitchenette and a separate shower room.\n\nThe kitchenette includes an oven, hob, under-counter fridge and washing machine, while fitted storage provides space for everyday essentials. The raised bed makes efficient use of the studio's floor area, with seating beneath."
      },
